astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b8q1sMqyyxMQ7kNvwEDZrDk&_nc_oc=Adn_SMoL3d3PL9TV67uMjLfCIagzuoqQA8HNGOnOArj25J8rxomshALm9BXBl0fmbCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu_qduydRSR1orKWJMxCO-BMFtkVMcFKwRcvpG__xQV4Q&oe=69A2C9F3"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZwkiR1atD2wQ7kNvwFbY6eu&_nc_oc=AdmXOYco38cCEGfAPLK7ptXRcVmPEhQmI1lHos0DCCpPPsCWZqOMPFPXcd9hVWLdFHY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft4l6imjLmiiH566853Xixn5UrE6CXlC-rvENvyMO161Q&oe=69A2CA96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jMGUB-H5lZ8Q7kNvwHl33EP&_nc_oc=Adn5j1a3LUKFSLMpOFKyuUQy-g060wHXL3fjOukuQqKp6THUjhlPbqaQym5LuW542Cs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftKDqc_I4Sn5J1RJFXv-xI3nrzTROmE9fnUhZKti8Vj4w&oe=69A2E93D"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip